/dvc_poc_bundle

# CRYPTO-NG4 lane A8: raw WS bytes are NEVER committed (contract field 7:
# content-addressed root under ~/.my-quantitative-data/crypto-ng4-ws/raw/);
# the repo-relative data_raw location stays gitignored as a guard.
/data_raw/
# collector runtime state (heartbeats, logs, connection journal) — pidfiles
